		"devdoc": {
			"details": "Prices are set directly in ETN (wei), NOT derived from a live USD feed.      Defaults below are illustrative starting points based on ETN's spot price      at time of writing (~$0.0009 USD, highly volatile) and should be revisited      periodically by the owner via setPrices().",
